{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"16907fe07c4bb266d28d66d5996b9f9dfe9a0d925dbb68ba0e09c89b36b5cb0d","digest":{"component_or_area":"test fixture conftest","key_entities":["_rebar_repo_template","tests/interfaces/conftest.py","rebar.list_tickets()","rebar.init_repo()","pytest.MonkeyPatch.context()","tests/interfaces/test_rebar_repo_isolation.py::test_template_stays_virgin",".rebar","REBAR_ROOT"],"problem_keywords":["fixture assertion","template virginity","test isolation","ticket seeding"],"propositions":["The template fixture asserts only that `.rebar` does not exist, but lacks an assertion that no tickets are seeded into the template at construction.","Test-level ticket virginity checks in `test_template_stays_virgin` fire only when that test is selected, leaving narrowed pytest runs like `pytest tests/interfaces/store` unprotected.","The missing assertion must execute inside the `MonkeyPatch.context()` block where `REBAR_ROOT` and `cwd` are pinned to the template, because `rebar.list_tickets()` requires that environment.","Adding `assert rebar.list_tickets() == []` inside the context after `rebar.init_repo()` enforces the full virginity invariant at fixture construction, covering all consumers once per worker."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787671781763666001,"uuid":"dbaa1d4b-fbe7-49ba-b4af-f1c3ce8bcbe4"}